File: src/fit_field_base.cpp
Function: FieldBase::GetScale
One decode of the test corpus takes about 358.509 ms.
The code below currently runs at 0.865992 of the original SDK's decode time; the best found so far is 0.861211.

Rewrite this function to make decoding faster:
```cpp
FIT_FLOAT64 FieldBase::GetScale(const FIT_UINT16 subFieldIndex) const
{
    if (subFieldIndex >= GetNumSubFields())
        return GetScale();

    auto subfield = GetSubField(subFieldIndex);
    return NULL != subfield ? subfield->scale : 1.0;
}
```
